---
description: >-
  LR-orientation gitgraph with parallelCommits: true where branch-A is
  created off branch-B (itself created with an explicit order: 2) and
  immediately merges main, before branch-B merges branch-A - testing a
  merge performed on a freshly created branch. Despite the "vertical-
  branch" file name this fixture uses LR orientation; compare with
  release/49, its TB-orientation twin with otherwise identical content.
config:
  gitGraph:
    parallelCommits: true
---
gitGraph LR:
  commit id:"1-abcdefg"

  branch branch-B order: 2
  commit id:"2-abcdefg"

  branch branch-A
  merge main

  checkout branch-B
  merge branch-A
